  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:30-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. My name is Ricardo Valdez. I'm calling for my mother, she's got a house at 34 Memorial Boulevard, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:38-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:41-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So we're doing a renovation, the kitchen mostly, and we need a dumpster. On the street, because the driveway is too narrow. Is there a permit for that? A dumpster permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:51-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, if the dumpster's going on the street, you'll need a permit for that. Doesn't matter if it's a day or a couple weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:59-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. And the company, the rental company, they don't handle the permit? I thought maybe they handle the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:06-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some will offer, some won't. Ask them before you assume. Either way it's the property owner's name that matters, so your mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, her name, not mine. Got it. And the fee? Is there a fee for the permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:19-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is, yeah. I don't have the exact amount in front of me. Let me put you through to the permit desk, they can give you the number and tell you what to fill out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:30-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Sorry, I'm a little scattered. I hung a new curtain rod this morning and now I feel like I'm an expert on everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:38-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, I'll transfer you. Stay on the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:56:42-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. I'll wait."
    }
  ],
